{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24657","headline":"谈氏小外孙玉童 · 白居易","name":"谈氏小外孙玉童","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外翁七十孙三岁，笑指琴书欲遣传。\n自念老夫今耄矣，因思稚子更茫然。\n中郎余庆锺羊祜，子幼能文似马迁。\n才与不才争料得，东牀空後且娇怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}